As I said at today's club membership meeting, I'm willing to volunteer=20
as the *_/Assistant/_*=C2=A02027 Field Day Chair.

With Field Day 2027 on the horizon, it's time to get our planning=20
committee together on a regular cadence. I'd like to propose holding=20
monthly Zoom calls on the *second and/or fourth Monday of each=20
**month=C2=A0at 8:00 PM*, running from now through the end of July 2027.=C2=
=A0 If=20
Mondays don't work, I'm open to other weekday evenings, but can't=20
guarantee I can make all the calls.

These meetings will help us work through the action items coming out of=20
our 2026 debrief =E2=80=94 drafting a field day chairperson, site reservati=
ons,=20
equipment inventory, logging setup, operator training, GOTA coverage,=20
digital & satellite stations, and more.

*Proposed meeting dates:*

Date 	Notes
Mon, Oct 26, 2026 	Kickoff
Mon, Nov 9, 2026 =09
Mon, Nov 23, 2026 	/(week before Thanksgiving =E2=80=94 confirm or skip)/
Mon, Dec 14, 2026 =09
Mon, Dec 28, 2026 	/(week after Christmas =E2=80=94 confirm or skip)/
Mon, Jan 11, 2027 =09
Mon, Jan 25, 2027 =09
Mon, Feb 8, 2027 =09
Mon, Feb 22, 2027 =09
Mon, Mar 8, 2027 =09
Mon, Mar 22, 2027 =09
Mon, Apr 12, 2027 =09
Mon, Apr 26, 2027 =09
Mon, May 10, 2027 =09
Mon, May 24, 2027 =09
Mon, Jun 14, 2027 	Final push before Field Day (Jun 26=E2=80=9327)
Mon, Jun 28, 2027 	/Skip =E2=80=94 Field Day recovery/
Mon, Jul 12, 2027 	After-action review
Mon, Jul 26, 2027 	Wrap-up

/Nov 23 and Dec 28 fall near holidays =E2=80=94 confirm or skip as needed./

*Key dates for context:*

Date 	Event
Mon=E2=80=93Thu, Jun 21=E2=80=9324, 2027 	Radio Camp
Fri, Jun 25, 2027 	Site setup
Sat=E2=80=93Sun, Jun 26=E2=80=9327, 2027 	*Field Day*
Sat, Jul 17, 2027 	Club membership meeting =E2=80=94 Field Day presentation

*Proposed time:* 8:00 PM Pacific *
Zoom link:* /TBD (@Scott, KC7SAG?)/

We'll try to keep the meetings to *60 minutes or less*. We'll share=20
agendas in advance and post notes afterward so anyone who misses a call=20
can stay in the loop.

Reply to let me know if this schedule works for you, or if there's a=20
better recurring time slot.

73,


-- Tom, KE4HET


